{title: Aankhon Se Batana}
{artist: Dikshant}
{key: A#}

{c: Verse 1}
[A#] Tum aankhon se batana,        Hum [Gm] samajh jaayenge
Tum [D#] halki si sharmana,        Hum tere [F] ho jaayen [A#] ge
[A#] Hum raah taake baithey hai,        [Gm] koi ijazat do
[A#] Hum raah taake baithey hai,        [Gm] koi ijazat [A#] do
[A#] Tum haath thaam lena,        Hum [Gm] sawar jaayenge
[A#] Tum aankhon se batana,        Hum [Gm] samajh jaayenge
Tum [D#] halki si sharmana,        Hum tere [F] ho jaayen [A#] ge
[A#] Tumhari mehendi mein,        [Gm] Chhupe hum rahe
[D#] Baatein karna humse,        Bin [F] kuch tum [A#] kahe
[A#] Hum khamoshi padhlenge,        [Gm] Agar chup tum raho
[A#] Hum khamoshi padhlenge,        [G] Agar chup tum raho
[A#] Tum aadat bano [Gm] humari,        Hum [D#] bigad jaayen [A#] ge
[A#] Tum aankhon se batana,        Hum [Gm] samajh jaayenge
Tum [D#] halki si sharmana,        Hum tere [F] ho jaayen [A#] ge
[A#] Yaar mere pyaar ka matlab,        [Gm] Samajhta nahi zamaana
[D#] Zamaane ki fikar nahi,        Main [F] chahoon tumhein [A#] samjhana
Ho [A#] ik meri khwaish yahin,        Ke [Gm] tum mein hai bass jaana
Ho [D#] jitni bhi muradein teri,        Main [F] pure sab kar [A#] jaana
[A#] Kaagazon par sabne,        [Gm] Apne lafz likhe
[A#] Humne apne jazbaat bhi,        [Gm] sajaa ke hai [A#] rakhe
[A#] Tum ankhon mein dekho [Gm] humari,        sab [D#] samajh jaao [A#] gey
[A#] Tum aankhon se batana,        Hum [Gm] samajh jaayenge
Tum [D#] halki si sharmana,        Hum tere [F] ho jaayen [A#] ge
